Providing a model using CDS:

ds(data, key="hr", adjustment="herm", truncation = 700,
             region.table = regions, sample.table = samples, obs.table = observations)
(AIC= 1911.957)

gives the following cluster size estimates:

Expected cluster size
  Region Expected.S se.Expected.S cv.Expected.S
  Total   6.613722     0.9939091     0.1502798

Providing a model with the cluster size as a covariate:

